type: software
title: "Le Domaine de Hương (Trang viên tri thức · Knowledge Manor): an interactive 3D scene of a scholar's estate"
abstract: >-
  An interactive 3D scene that runs entirely in the browser and makes no
  network request at all. A visitor walks, cycles or paddles a sampan through
  eight themed zones of a Mekong-Delta estate — research, library, music,
  storytelling, news, the main house, the lantern path and a future store —
  each with its own silhouette, signboard and content panel. The scene carries
  four lighting states (morning, afternoon, night and a noir mode), an orbiting
  survey camera, a clustered planting system, a river the sampan is confined
  to, and five gameplay modules (achievements, side quests, a play loop, a
  mini-game and a story quest). Narration is the author's own recorded voice in
  Vietnamese and English. Built from plain HTML, CSS and JavaScript with no
  build step and no server-side component, and published as a static site.
